WEBVTT

00:04:29.682 --> 00:04:34.395
This means having chemistry in hand
that may act lifelike.

00:04:34.395 --> 00:04:36.397
This is really remarkable.

00:04:36.397 --> 00:04:38.899
So we might wonder:

00:04:38.899 --> 00:04:43.195
What do we do when we have
this knowledge in our hands?

00:04:44.947 --> 00:04:48.159
This may mean that
we would be able to connect the dots

00:04:48.159 --> 00:04:51.037
between nonliving and living

00:04:51.078 --> 00:04:56.834
and understand how chemistry
is translating and transforming

00:04:56.876 --> 00:05:00.004
and transitioning
into a lifelike behavior.